2><c>we </c><00:00:01.063><c>have  </c><00:00:01.064><c>completed </c><00:00:01.065><c>the </c><00:00:01.066><c>solution </c><00:00:01.067><c>to </c><00:00:01.068><c>this </c><00:00:01.069><c>problem  </c><00:00:01.070><c>we </c><00:00:01.071><c>found </c><00:00:01.072><c>the </c><00:00:01.073><c>CDF </c><00:00:01.074><c>and </c><00:00:01.075><c>we </c><00:00:01.076><c>found </c><00:00:01.077><c>the  </c><00:00:01.078><c>corresponding </c><00:00:01.079><c>PDF </c><00:00:01.080><c>this </c><00:00:01.081><c>methodology </c><00:00:01.082><c>works  </c><00:00:01.083><c>more </c><00:00:01.084><c>generally </c><00:00:01.085><c>for </c><00:00:01.086><c>more </c><00:00:01.087><c>complicated  </c><00:00:01.088><c>functions </c><00:00:01.089><c>of </c><00:00:01.090><c>x </c><00:00:01.091><c>and </c><00:00:01.092><c>y </c><00:00:01.093><c>and </c><00:00:01.094><c>for </c><00:00:01.095><c>more  </c><00:00:01.096><c>complicated </c><00:00:01.097><c>distributions </c><00:00:01.098><c>for </c><00:00:01.099><c>x </c><00:00:01.100><c>and </c><00:00:01.101><c>y </c><00:00:01.102><c>of  </c><00:00:01.103><c>course </c><00:00:01.104><c>when </c><00:00:01.105><c>the </c><00:00:01.106><c>functions </c><00:00:01.107><c>or </c><00:00:01.108><c>the  </c><00:00:01.109><c>distributions </c><00:00:01.110><c>are </c><00:00:01.111><c>more </c><00:00:01.112><c>complicated </c><00:00:01.113><c>the  </c><00:00:01.114><c>calculus </c><00:00:01.115><c>involved </c><00:00:01.116><c>in </c><00:00:01.117><c>the </c><00:00:01.118><c>geometry </c><00:00:01.119><c>may  </c><00:00:01.120><c>require </c><00:00:01.121><c>a </c><00:00:01.122><c>lot </c><00:00:01.123><c>more </c><00:00:01.124><c>work </c><00:00:01.125><c>but </c><00:00:01.126><c>conceptually  </c><00:00:01.127><c>the </c><00:00:01.128><c>methodology </c><00:00:01.129><c>is </c><00:00:01.130><c>exactly </c><00:00:01.131><c>the </c><00:00:01.132><c>same</c>

